  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_scope",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 1020,
        "y": 0
      },
      "text": "A/C AMPLIFIER SPUR. Receiving side of IX_AC_CTS (TW/return to auto amp A34). Three 2026-09-30 circuits as labeled flying leads, no OEM A/C housings: Aux 4 kill -> A18-11 ACT; clutch A4-2 <-> A18-9 MG; pressure A5-4 <-> A18-13. Sources and the A18-11 assumption: docs/harness/ACAMP-SPUR-LABELS.md. Solar and TAM not this pass. Amplifier not drawn."
    }
  ],
